      "title": "check_typed_item_calls.py:  Improve checks around items in bitmask calls",
      "message": "check_typed_item_calls.py:  Improve checks around items in bitmask calls\n\n- If an item appears in a fields array, make sure it has a non-zero mask.\n- Don't suggest a mask should be 0 for item that appears in fields array\n- Fix up existing items found\n\nNote that there are lots of fields where there is neither a literal macro\nnor a simple macro that can be resolved to a value, so doubtless some\ninstances of this are being missed.\n",
